# A Word document that changed is merged into the SDoc file written by an
# earlier import: Word wins on its fields, the extra field OWNER and the File
# relation added by hand are kept, a requirement that left the Word document is
# kept in its own section, and the report lists every difference.

RUN: %mkdir %T
RUN: %cp %S/existing.sdoc %T/input.sdoc
RUN: %strictdoc convert %S/input.docx %T/ --docx-profile %S/profile.py | filecheck %s
CHECK: Word import: 2 requirement(s), 1 section(s)
CHECK: Merged into the existing file: 1 added, 1 changed, 0 unchanged, 1 not in the Word document.
CHECK: Added: SYS-0003
CHECK: Changed: SYS-0001 (VERSION, LINKED_REQ, STATEMENT)
CHECK: Kept in 'Not in the Word document': SYS-0002

RUN: %diff %T/input.sdoc %S/expected/input.sdoc
